{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Incoming transmission...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From beyond the familiar skies of L\u00f6ckelle...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An accident during a routine mission to test the new Quilez thrusters for single-person space travel, a solo L\u00f6ckonaut stranded very far from L\u00f6ckelle. This is where the Eco-Friendly Operations Corporation claims to have discovered the ultimate solution to waste disposal, at least according to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with Tier-1 and Mainframe, the last of the rebel crew, as you embark on a mission to stop E.F.O. Corp. before they destroy the planet with their artificial black hole waste disposal system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter space anomalies like gravity-changing crystals and the concerning threat of an artificial black hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extraterrestrial maps to explore-and-escape from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip your spacesuit and use the new tools for traversal and destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet your loyal companion, Tier-1, and forge a friendship that just might save the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2657100?t=1750766096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2657100?t=1750766096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657100/7befa59cfb2fc21dd185bd46bdf298fbee639adc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750766096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657100/7befa59cfb2fc21dd185bd46bdf298fbee639adc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750766096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"S